### TeamForge Phase 10 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Platform Durability (Snapshot to File and Restore, UTC Time Handling, Reputation Ledger Pagination)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@superUserToken = Bearer YOUR_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. REPUTATION LEDGER PAGINATION & FILTERING
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. User Reputation Ledger (Default Page 1, Limit 20)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { items: [...], page: 1, limit: 20, total: N }
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/reputation
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

###

### 1b. User Reputation Ledger (Custom Page and Limit)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { items: [...], page: 2, limit: 5, total: N }
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/reputation?page=2&limit=5
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

###

### 1c. User Reputation Ledger (Filter by Type: task_approved)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: items containing only type === 'task_approved'
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/reputation?type=task_approved
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

###

### 1d. Invalid Pagination Limit > 100
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: INVALID_PAGINATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/reputation?limit=101
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

###

### 1e. Invalid Pagination Limit <= 0
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: INVALID_PAGINATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/reputation?limit=0
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

###

### 1f. Invalid Pagination Page <= 0
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: INVALID_PAGINATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/reputation?page=-1
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. ADMIN REPUTATION LEDGER
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. Admin View User Reputation
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { items: [...], page: 1, limit: 10, total: N }
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/2/reputation?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-role: admin

###

### 2b. Admin View Platform Reputation Ledger
# Expected Status: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reputation?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-role: admin

###

### 2c. Collaborator Forbidden from Admin Reputation
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/2/reputation
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-role: collaborator

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. SUPER USER SNAPSHOT MANAGEMENT
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Super User Triggers Manual Snapshot Save
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { savedAt: "ISO_UTC", sizeBytes: 12345 }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/snapshot
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
x-user-role: superuser

###

### 3b. Super User Checks Snapshot Telemetry
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { savedAt: "...", sizeBytes: ... }
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/snapshot
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
x-user-role: superuser

###

### 3c. Regular Admin Forbidden from Saving Snapshot
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/snapshot
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
x-user-role: admin

###

### 3d. Collaborator Forbidden from Saving Snapshot
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/snapshot
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-role: collaborator
